<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#F7F9FC', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
  {/* 页眉 A3 */}
  <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 80, background: '#0E3F8C', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '0 40px', gap: 16 }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 6, height: 36, background: '#FFC107' }} />
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>项目定位与核心问题</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#C9D8F0', marginLeft: 18 }}>医学判定交代码 · 表达交模型</Text>
  </Box>
  {/* 内容区 */}
  <Box style={{ height: 580, flexDirection: 'row', padding: '24px 40px', gap: 24 }}>
    {/* 左栏：定位卡 + 真实登录页截图 */}
    <Box style={{ width: 420, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 16 }}>
      <Box style={{ background: '#0E3F8C', borderRadius: 12, padding: '20px 24px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#8B9CC4', marginBottom: 8 }}>一句话定位</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
          为老年慢病患者提供「<span style={{ color: '#FFC107' }}>能记录、能判定、能解释、能被医生调整</span>」的日常健康管理工具
        </Text>
      </Box>
      <Image src="assets/login.png" style={{ width: 420, height: 320, objectFit: 'cover', borderRadius: 12, border: '1px solid #D6DCE5' }} />
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>▲ 系统登录页 · 示范病例一键进入（真实界面截图）</Text>
    </Box>
    {/* 右栏：5 个核心问题 → 解法 */}
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12 }}>
      <Box style={{ background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 10, padding: '14px 20px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16, flex: 1 }}>
        <FAIcon name='question-circle' style={{ fill: '#1E4FA8', width: 30, height: 30 }} />
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>老人看不懂指标数字</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568' }}>→ 四级产品词表：提示 / 关注 / 预警 / 紧急，每级配可执行动作</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 10, padding: '14px 20px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16, flex: 1 }}>
        <FAIcon name='shield' style={{ fill: '#1E4FA8', width: 30, height: 30 }} />
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>AI 直接给医学结论不可信</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568' }}>→ 规则判定全由代码计算，模型只转自然语言，不自定阈值</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 10, padding: '14px 20px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16, flex: 1 }}>
        <FAIcon name='database' style={{ fill: '#1E4FA8', width: 30, height: 30 }} />
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>一天多次测量容易被覆盖</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568' }}>→ 事实层「一次测量一条、纯追加、永不覆盖」，作废只打状态位</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 10, padding: '14px 20px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16, flex: 1 }}>
        <FAIcon name='user-md' style={{ fill: '#1E4FA8', width: 30, height: 30 }} />
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>AI 建议没人把关</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568' }}>→ 任务调整一律进入 pending，医生审结后才生效</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 10, padding: '14px 20px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16, flex: 1 }}>
        <FAIcon name='chart-bar' style={{ fill: '#1E4FA8', width: 30, height: 30 }} />
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>AI 评分不可解释</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568' }}>→ 两层分离：规则分（官方）/ AI 辅助分（仅参考）</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  {/* 底部结论条 */}
  <Box style={{ height: 60, background: '#1E4FA8', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 600 }}>
      核心原则：任何涉及数字的环节都不经过大模型 —— 从架构上排除数值幻觉
    </Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
